<title>MEXICO: BANCO DE MEXICO NET RESERVES, ASSETS RISE.</title>
<headline>BANCO DE MEXICO NET RESERVES, ASSETS RISE.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said on Tuesday its international reserves as of August 8 were $22.726 billion, compared to $22.485 billion on August 1.</p>
<p>The central bank said that its net international assets as of the same date were $15.609 billion compared to $15.360 billion the week before.</p>
